1
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,790
If you share your heart at Maum Cafe,

2
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:12,540
you get a magic recipe coin.

3
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:15,510
Any feeling at all

4
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:17,930
can become a delicious dessert ingredient.

5
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:22,900
Welcome to Maum Cafe,

6
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:26,270
where magic recipes understand your heart.

7
00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:31,290
Ugh, so slow, so slow! Why is everything so slow?!

8
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:36,510
Hurry, hurry! My teacher keeps telling me to stay still!

9
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,540
She only ever scolds me!

10
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:42,000
I want to move faster!!

11
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:47,280
Oh my, you must have felt so stuffy and upset all this time.

12
00:00:48,730 --> 00:00:53,200
Try putting this coin into the Heart Exchange Machine.

13
00:00:56,730 --> 00:01:01,540
I wonder what flavor this feeling will make?

14
00:01:01,590 --> 00:01:03,860
It's just water right now,

15
00:01:03,910 --> 00:01:07,530
but if we wait until all the ice melts,

16
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:10,590
it becomes a rainbow-colored juice.

17
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:15,380
I'm curious what it tastes like when all seven colors show up.

18
00:01:16,830 --> 00:01:21,180
I want some, I want some!! It's still orange!

19
00:01:21,230 --> 00:01:24,110
How many ice cubes are left?!

20
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:28,420
Wow!! Whoa!!! A rainbow!

21
00:01:28,470 --> 00:01:30,650
I've never tasted anything like this!!!

22
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:37,740
Everyone... keeps... running away... when they see me...

23
00:01:37,790 --> 00:01:42,490
I only wanted to play... *sniff*...

24
00:01:43,940 --> 00:01:48,610
Oh dear, you must have been so lonely.

25
00:01:48,660 --> 00:01:53,020
Would you like to put this coin into the Heart Exchange Machine?

26
00:01:54,470 --> 00:01:59,340
I wonder what flavor this feeling will make?

27
00:01:59,390 --> 00:02:03,090
Here, Lion, have some Courage Popcorn.

28
00:02:03,140 --> 00:02:07,680
The more courage you find, the more the popcorn will pop and grow.

29
00:02:09,130 --> 00:02:11,710
Wou... would you... like some?

30
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:14,990
It's popcorn...

31
00:02:17,130 --> 00:02:22,680
I still have lots of popcorn left. Tasty, isn't it?

32
00:02:23,180 --> 00:02:26,130
Thank you, it's so nutty!

33
00:02:26,180 --> 00:02:27,080
Give me some, give me some!

34
00:02:27,130 --> 00:02:29,950
Lion, come eat with us!

35
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:35,320
I hate Mom, I hate my brother, I hate everyone.

36
00:02:35,370 --> 00:02:38,340
They always say it's my fault.

37
00:02:38,390 --> 00:02:42,380
And this time I really didn't break it...

38
00:02:43,830 --> 00:02:48,870
Oh my, how unfair and sad that must have felt...

39
00:02:49,370 --> 00:02:52,920
But... I'm not supposed to hate people, right?

40
00:02:52,970 --> 00:02:55,840
Will you accept a bad feeling like this too?

41
00:02:57,290 --> 00:03:01,640
Dochi, there are no bad feelings in this world.

42
00:03:01,690 --> 00:03:05,340
What you're feeling right now

43
00:03:05,390 --> 00:03:08,430
has a good reason to be felt.

44
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:12,950
Shall we put this coin into the Heart Exchange Machine?

45
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:17,200
I wonder what flavor this feeling will make?

46
00:03:18,650 --> 00:03:24,210
A fluffy cotton-candy parfait to hug your heart.

47
00:03:24,260 --> 00:03:29,390
No matter how prickly the feeling, I'll hold it all.

48
00:03:29,890 --> 00:03:35,630
Ah, so cozy. I feel soft and fluffy and calm!

49
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,670
I'm moving tomorrow.

50
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:41,350
The new forest I've never seen is scary,

51
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,620
but I'm curious too.

52
00:03:42,670 --> 00:03:45,740
I'm excited to meet new friends,

53
00:03:45,790 --> 00:03:47,280
but I also want to hide...

54
00:03:47,330 --> 00:03:49,810
Maybe there's something strange about me.

55
00:03:51,260 --> 00:03:54,060
Oh my, so many feelings at once

56
00:03:54,110 --> 00:03:57,320
must have made your heart feel dizzy.

57
00:03:57,370 --> 00:03:59,980
But a feeling's color

58
00:04:00,030 --> 00:04:02,650
doesn't have to be just one.

59
00:04:02,700 --> 00:04:06,310
Even I am happy to meet guests,

60
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:08,960
and sometimes I want to rest, too.

61
00:04:09,010 --> 00:04:13,500
Would you like to put this coin into the Heart Exchange Machine?

62
00:04:14,950 --> 00:04:19,250
I wonder what flavor this feeling will make?

63
00:04:19,300 --> 00:04:22,450
Many feelings came together

64
00:04:22,500 --> 00:04:25,050
and made a one-of-a-kind color!

65
00:04:25,100 --> 00:04:27,850
Here, have a colorful

66
00:04:27,900 --> 00:04:30,460
swirl lollipop.

67
00:04:31,910 --> 00:04:34,070
Wow! It's so pretty!

68
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:38,270
My heart was such a beautiful color!

69
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:40,200
It's sweet! It's delicious!

70
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:45,720
'The cafe owner is on vacation.'

71
00:04:46,220 --> 00:04:51,310
What is this! Dad promised to play with me,

72
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:56,460
and he didn't keep his promise, and I'm so upset! Waaah!

73
00:04:57,910 --> 00:05:02,500
So it was Rabbit! It's okay! Come on in!

74
00:05:03,950 --> 00:05:07,240
We're looking after Maum Cafe for the boss.

75
00:05:07,740 --> 00:05:10,780
We don't have magic recipes like Bara,

76
00:05:10,830 --> 00:05:14,340
but we made this with what each of us brought.

77
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:19,940
It's hwachae! And there's apple, my favorite!

78
00:05:19,990 --> 00:05:22,150
Thank you, everyone!

79
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:27,440
We made it ourselves, but it's really good.

80
00:05:27,940 --> 00:05:32,490
But when is Bara coming back?

81
00:05:32,990 --> 00:05:36,250
I miss the boss.

82
00:05:37,700 --> 00:05:41,480
Everyone, I'm back! Oh my,

83
00:05:41,530 --> 00:05:45,320
you were here. A real magic recipe!

84
00:05:46,770 --> 00:05:49,660
Please come visit Maum Cafe again.

85
00:05:49,710 --> 00:05:53,450
Every feeling is welcome, anytime.

86
00:05:53,950 --> 00:05:57,110
Where did you go on vacation, boss?

87
00:05:57,610 --> 00:05:59,350
It's a secret!
